  "title": "z-planelandscape of Im F, sheets k = 1…5landscape",
  "cap": "The landscape of $F(z)=\\log z$ over the $z$-plane: the height is $\\operatorname{Im} F$ and the colour $\\arg F$ (bar); the sheets $k=1,\\dots,5$ of infinitely many are shown. On its natural domain $D=\\{z : \\arg z\\neq 180^\\circ\\}$, $F$ is analytic and conformal onto its image; these properties are guaranteed by the chain.",
  "tex": "Landscape of $F$ over $[-8,8]\\times[-5,5]$, where\\ifinner\\hskip\\hsize\\else\\[ \\displaystyle F(z)=\\log z. \\]\\fi The height is $\\operatorname{Im} F$ and the color shows $\\arg F$; the sheets $k=1,\\dots,5$ of infinitely many are shown."
 },
